# The exact denial each document in storage-null-spec-claim.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both.
PersistentVolumeClaim storage-null-spec-claim has no usable spec mapping and cannot be evaluated
PersistentVolumeClaim storage-null-spec-claim must name an enumerated storageClassName
